<title>HONG KONG: HK's Arts Optical debuts at HK$1.70.</title>
<headline>HK's Arts Optical debuts at HK$1.70.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of eye glass frame manufacturer Arts Optical International Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.70 in Hong Kong, compared with their issue price of HK$1.00 per share.  </p>
<p>The shares then quickly climbed to HK$2.25 in the first 10 minutes of trade.</p>
<p>Arts Optical offered 84.5 million shares in Hong Kong at HK$1.00 per share of which the approximately 76 million shares available for public subscription was some 261 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds would be used to expand its production capacity, acquire licences for recognised brand names, repay bank loans and provide general working capital.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
